{"v": 1, "kind": "explainer", "title": "Gravity five-engine Jet Suit: how it flies (schematic)", "primary": "solid", "notes": {"t1": {"basis": "F4 F5 F6 Flying Magazine 2022, ASME 2019, F6 likely"}, "t2": {"unchecked": "F8 F9 F11 Electronic Specifier 2022, claimed"}, "t3": {"unchecked": "F17 F18 ASME 2019, Electronic Specifier 2022, claimed"}}, "board": {"v": 1, "items": [{"id": "cap", "k": "text", "at": [6, 7], "text": "Key figures"}]}, "solid": {"v": 2, "units": "mm", "params": {"input": 0, "explode": 0}, "parts": [{"id": "pilot", "use": "mannequin", "with": {"leftShoulder": 20, "rightShoulder": 20}}, {"id": "jetB", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 110, "length": 280, "cutaway": 0}, "parent": "pilot.back", "at": [0, 55, 0], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}, {"id": "jetL1", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 70, "length": 200, "cutaway": 1}, "parent": "pilot.leftHand", "at": [0, -45, 150], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}, {"id": "jetL2", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 70, "length": 200, "cutaway": 0}, "parent": "pilot.leftHand", "at": [0, 45, 150], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}, {"id": "jetR1", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 70, "length": 200, "cutaway": 0}, "parent": "pilot.rightHand", "at": [0, -45, 150], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}, {"id": "jetR2", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 70, "length": 200, "cutaway": 0}, "parent": "pilot.rightHand", "at": [0, 45, 150], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}], "constraints": [], "annotations": {"labels": [{"id": "lSuit", "at": {"part": "pilot.skull", "point": "centre"}, "text": "Five-engine Jet Suit, 2019 to present", "unchecked": "F4 Flying Magazine 2022, ASME 2019"}, {"id": "lThrust", "at": {"world": [0, -450, 900]}, "text": "Thrust at each unit: reaction to its jet"}, {"id": "lWeight", "at": {"part": "pilot.body", "point": "centre"}, "text": "Pilot plus gear, claimed guess 90 kg", "unchecked": "F12 WIRED (Rhett Allain) 2018, claimed"}, {"id": "lSteer", "at": {"part": "pilot.handL", "point": "centre"}, "text": "Arm angle steers the arm jets", "unchecked": "F13 Electronic Specifier 2022, WIRED 2018"}, {"id": "lTrigger", "at": {"part": "pilot.handR", "point": "centre"}, "text": "Hand trigger sets thrust (claimed)", "unchecked": "F14 ASME 2019, claimed"}, {"id": "lExample", "at": {"part": "jetL1.shaft", "point": "centre"}, "text": "Micro turbojet-style engine (example)"}, {"id": "lNotConf", "at": {"part": "jetL1.casing", "point": "centre"}, "text": "Not confirmed Gravity hardware"}, {"id": "lImp", "at": {"part": "jetL1.impeller", "point": "centre"}, "text": "Compressor squeezes the air"}, {"id": "lDiff", "at": {"part": "jetL1.diffuser", "point": "centre"}, "text": "Diffuser slows the air, pressure rises"}, {"id": "lComb", "at": {"part": "jetL1.combustor", "point": "centre"}, "text": "Combustor: kerosene burns in the air", "unchecked": "F16 WIRED 2018, ASME 2019"}, {"id": "lTurb", "at": {"part": "jetL1.turbineWheel", "point": "centre"}, "text": "Turbine turns the shared shaft"}, {"id": "lNoz", "at": {"part": "jetL1.nozzle", "point": "centre"}, "text": "Nozzle: gas speeds out as the jet"}], "arrows": [{"id": "aW", "meaning": "force", "cause": "gravity", "from": {"part": "pilot.body", "offset": [0, -300, -100]}, "to": {"part": "pilot.body", "offset": [0, -300, -400]}, "text": "Weight"}, {"id": "aTB", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "jetB.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 160]}, "to": {"part": "jetB.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 40]}}, {"id": "aTL1", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "jetL1.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 140]}, "to": {"part": "jetL1.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 30]}}, {"id": "aTL2", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "jetL2.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 140]}, "to": {"part": "jetL2.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 30]}}, {"id": "aTR1", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "jetR1.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 140]}, "to": {"part": "jetR1.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 30]}}, {"id": "aTR2", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "jetR2.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 140]}, "to": {"part": "jetR2.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 30]}}, {"id": "aSteer", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "jetL2.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 220]}, "to": {"part": "jetL2.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 60]}, "text": "Tilted thrust (schematic)"}, {"id": "aAir", "meaning": "flow", "from": {"part": "jetL1.intake", "offset": [0, 0, -150]}, "to": {"part": "jetL1.intake", "offset": [0, 0, -10]}, "text": "Air in"}, {"id": "aJet", "meaning": "flow", "from": {"part": "jetL1.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 10]}, "to": {"part": "jetL1.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 180]}, "text": "Hot gas out"}]}}, "beats": [{"say": "The Gravity Jet Suit: the pilot wears small jet engines, a unit on the back and a cluster on each forearm. The table gives the published engine counts.", "highlight": ["t1.r1", "t1.r2", "t1.r3"], "ops": [{"op": "add", "item": {"id": "t1", "k": "table", "at": [6, 4], "header": true, "cells": [["Item", "Count"], ["Engines", 5], ["On back", 1], ["Arm, likely", 2]]}}], "view": {"camera": "hero", "annotate": ["lSuit", "lThrust", "aTB", "aTL1", "aTL2", "aTR1", "aTR2"]}}, {"say": "Each jet pushes hot gas down and the reaction pushes its unit up. In a hover the upward thrusts balance the weight of pilot, suit and fuel, and side forces and turning moments cancel.", "highlight": ["t2.r1", "t2.r2", "t2.r3", "pilot.body"], "ops": [{"op": "remove", "id": "t1"}, {"op": "add", "item": {"id": "t2", "k": "table", "at": [6, 4], "header": true, "cells": [["Claimed", "Value"], ["Arms max N", 800], ["Back max N", 400], ["Thrust/wt", 1.3]]}}], "view": {"camera": "hero", "annotate": ["aW", "lWeight", "lThrust", "aTB", "aTL1", "aTL2", "aTR1", "aTR2"]}}, {"say": "To steer, the pilot raises the left arm. The engines fixed to that forearm tilt with it, so their thrust leans sideways and the suit moves.", "highlight": ["pilot.upperArmL", "jetL1", "jetL2"], "ops": [{"op": "remove", "id": "t2"}], "view": {"camera": "hero", "pose": {"pilot": {"with": {"leftShoulder": 45, "rightShoulder": 20}}}, "annotate": ["lSteer", "lTrigger", "aSteer", "aTL1", "aTL2"]}}, {"say": "Cut open, an arm engine: air enters the intake, the spinning compressor squeezes it, and the diffuser slows it so its pressure rises.", "highlight": ["jetL1.impeller", "jetL1.diffuser"], "view": {"camera": "hero", "spin": 1, "focus": ["jetL1"], "ghost": ["jetL2"], "annotate": ["lExample", "lNotConf", "lImp", "lDiff", "aAir"]}}, {"say": "Fuel burns with the oxygen in the compressed air. The hot gas spins the turbine; the shaft makes {jetL1.input.speed} turn per input turn, so the turbine drives the compressor.", "highlight": ["jetL1.combustor", "jetL1.turbineWheel", "jetL1.shaft"], "check": [{"value": "jetL1.input.speed", "eq": 1}], "view": {"camera": "hero", "spin": 1, "focus": ["jetL1"], "ghost": ["jetL2"], "annotate": ["lComb", "lTurb", "lNotConf"]}}, {"say": "The gas speeds up through the nozzle and leaves as the jet. Thrust is the reaction to that gas pushed out: the push the arrows showed on the suit.", "highlight": ["jetL1.nozzle"], "view": {"camera": "hero", "spin": 1, "focus": ["jetL1"], "ghost": ["jetL2"], "annotate": ["lNoz", "aJet", "lNotConf"]}}, {"say": "The engine solves only the shapes and the shaft turning. Thrust, fuel flow, balance and flight time are published figures, not solved here, so this suit is a schematic.", "highlight": ["t3.r1", "t3.r2"], "ops": [{"op": "add", "item": {"id": "t3", "k": "table", "at": [6, 4], "header": true, "cells": [["Claimed", "Value"], ["Fuel L/min", 4], ["Flight min", 3]]}}], "view": {"camera": "hero", "annotate": ["lSuit", "aW", "aTB", "aTL1", "aTL2", "aTR1", "aTR2"]}}]}